# Budget App

A personal budgeting app inspired by Copilot Money.

## Structure

- `asset/` — Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS frontend.
- `api/` — Express + TypeScript API. Currently only `GET /health`; Plaid integration goes here.

Each API feature lives in `api/src/<feature>/` with a `controller/` (route declarations
plus one file per action in `controller/actions/`) and a `service/` holding the logic.
Routes are assembled in `api/src/routes.ts` and registered in `api/src/server.ts`.

## Running

```bash
cd asset && npm install && npm run dev   # http://localhost:3000
cd api   && npm install && npm run dev   # http://localhost:4000
```

Copy `api/.env.example` to `api/.env` before starting the API.

## Theme

Colors live as CSS variables in `asset/src/app/globals.css` and swap on the `.dark`
class of `<html>`: `#222831`, `#393E46`, `#948979`, `#DFD0B8`.
Light / dark / system is selectable on the Settings page and persists in `localStorage`.
